# =====================================================================
#  Surface features on the extended elevation -- the cliff faces the
#  two entrances open onto. Separate scrap for the same reason as on
#  the plan: Therion clips a scrap to its own outline, so a cliff
#  drawn inside the passage scrap either distorts the passage or, as
#  here, falls outside the outline and is clipped away unseen.
#
#  Stations 2 and 20 register the scrap against the centreline;
#  -visibility off keeps them from drawing twice.
# =====================================================================
scrap C10-ee-surface -projection extended

  point 217.60512 97.42748 station -name 2 -visibility off
  point 2728.8093 151.14374 station -name 20 -visibility off

